~Version ---------------------------------------------------
VERS.   2.0 : CWLS log ASCII Standard -VERSION 2.0
WRAP.    NO : One line per depth step
DLM . SPACE : Column Data Section Delimiter
~Well ------------------------------------------------------
STRT.M                0.00000 : Start Depth
STOP.M             2900.00000 : Stop Depth
STEP.M                0.50000 : Step
NULL.                 -999.25 : Null Value
COMP.       Oil India Limited : Company
WELL.            OIL-HAPJAN-1 : Well Name
FLD .                  Hapjan : Field Name
LOC .                         : LOCATION
PROV.                         : PROVINCE
CNTY.                         : COUNTY
STAT.                         : STATE
CTRY.                     IND : Country
SRVC. Synthetic Log Generator : Service Company
DATE.              2019-04-20 : DATE
UWI .                         : UNIQUE WELL ID
API .                         : API NUMBER
~Curve Information -----------------------------------------
DEPT.M     : Measured Depth
GR  .API   : Gamma Ray
RHOB.G/C3  : Bulk Density
NPHI.V/V   : Neutron Porosity
DTC .US/F  : Sonic Compressional Travel Time
RES .OHMM  : Deep Resistivity
